[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0010","text":"（阳希，是冰淇淋）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0020","text":"（华夫筒的──！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0030","text":"（制作人是……\n　要限定口味的好呢？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0040","text":"（路加是────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0060","text":"（可乐味的……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0070","text":"——嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0079","text":"便利店店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0080","text":"谢谢您——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0090","text":"…………好——热啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700300_04_0100","text":"（冰淇淋要化了──！）"}]
